WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:02.350
We got a great quest, guys!

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:06.320
It's from a place called Rift Village.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.200
And get this...

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.350
The reward is 100 times the normal amount!

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.190
Yay!

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.550
One hundred times normal sounds great, but...

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:15.720
What kind of quest is it?

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.430
I don't know.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:17.070
You don't know?

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.510
They said they'll tell you 
in person when you get there.

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.080
This sounds really shady.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:28.000
But completing this quest will bring us 
much closer to reopening the branch office!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.490
Just go talk them, at least!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:32.800
It's 100 times as much as usual, after all!

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.060
One hundred times!

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.010
Yay!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.820
How much do we usually get, anyway?

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.020
One percent as much as
 we're getting this time.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:06.960
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.150
<b>Episode 11: Fictional Story</b>

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.190
Welcome to our fretful village!

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:17.340
I'm the fidgety mayor of Rift Village!

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:20.060
And this is the most fretfully
important man in the region,

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:23.260
the mayor of Bossy Village!

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.790
Y'all look like a bunch 
of bossy wimps if you ask me!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.360
You sure you're worth all that
 boss money we're paying you?

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:34.150
I'm sorry. If you don't want to go through 
Arc End HQ, this is all you can get.

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:35.400
Fidget, fidget...

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.650
These guys are pretty rude.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:40.300
And it's really obvious who's in charge.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.140
So what's the quest, exactly?

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.340
What else, boss?

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.450
We want you to deal with those 
bossy jerks in Selfish Village!

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.520
Selfish Village?

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.740
Even more villages.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.650
That's Selfish Village, fidget...

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.470
Is that a village?

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:59.220
It's surrounded by a wall.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:03.320
We've always had problems with the 
fretfully selfish people in Selfish Village.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:06.610
They selfishly take all the 
fish in the lakes we all share,

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.620
or take our crops...

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:14.440
And at some point that fretful wall 
started encroaching on our land!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.460
They're pretty bold!

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.730
How did you not notice the wall?

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.780
Well, I didn't want to get into a fight.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.060
That's why nobody takes you seriously, boss!

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:26.070
And no matter what we say to the bossy
 mayor of Selfish Village, he doesn't care!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:30.280
Instead, he uses his pet 
spirals to boss us around!

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.730
He keeps spirals as pets?

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:35.840
Spirals!

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.780
Yeah, they're really up there.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.800
We don't know how he's doing it,

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.560
but you can fretfully see for yourself.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:45.670
The people who escaped from Selfish Village

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:49.960
say that the mayor is training 
an even bigger, bossier spiral!

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:52.070
If we're attacked by something like that,

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:54.530
it'll wipe out all the 
fidgety villages in the area!

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.580
Wipe them out?

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:08.330
Please, help us as we fidget and fret!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:12.640
Got it? Now sneak inside 
and beat that big spiral, bosses!

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.640
W-Wait a second.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:17.160
I understand what you're saying,
 but that's crazy.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.050
That's way too hard!

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.920
What will you do if we get caught?

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.000
Disavow any knowledge of your actions...

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.110
This is your quest, right?

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.980
Stop yer whining, boss!

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.960
It's too dangerous to make 
somebody from the village go!

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:33.930
That's why I'm hiring bossy outsiders, 
since I can always hire more!

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.710
He's not even trying to 
hide what he thinks of us.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.120
No way.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:41.240
One hundred times the usual
 reward isn't worth it.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:44.830
We'll do it for ninety-nine times
 the usual reward, guru!

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:48.300
Wiseman!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.850
The energy-saving version.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.000
Yeah, they're here, too.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.060
Who the hell are you?

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:57.100
We'll take this quest.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.660
Really, fret?

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:03.280
We just need to take out the big 
spiral behind the walls, right?

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.690
She summed it up in two seconds.

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:08.480
It's not that easy! Were you
 listening just now?

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:09.550
Don't do it!

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.620
You can still back out!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.430
Zel isn't worth your life!

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:14.850
We appreciate the warnings,

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:17.630
but our livelihoods depend on this, too.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.080
We're trying to add some 
accomplishments to our resume,

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.710
so Blackblack never fires us again.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.540
Yup!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:27.040
Don't worry. It's just a spat 
between country villages.

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:30.230
We can have this solved in no time!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.420
B-But...

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:33.850
Stop your whining, boss!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.270
You guys are heroes!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.320
Now, go teach that village
 of bossy demons a lesson!

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.890
Leave it to us, guru!

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:44.280
I see. So you turned it down.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.920
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:49.360
It's fine. If what that mayor said was true,

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.740
it's not something you 
could've handled yourself.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.610
Don't worry. It's not 
bothering me or anything.

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:58.830
I wasn't counting on that 
100 times usual quest reward.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.250
Looks like it's really bothering her.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.290
She was definitely counting on it.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.510
I'm just worried about Wiseman.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.230
I have a bad feeling.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:12.680
Like something awful is going to happen.

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:15.700
We're pretty close to the 
last episode, after all.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.140
Haru...

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.270
It'll be fine!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:25.020
Knowing them, they'll scram 
at the first sign of trouble.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.190
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.540
I hope nothing really bad happens to them.

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:38.410
Th-This is really bad, guru!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:43.160
What an awful mayor, eating a 
feast like that in front of us, guru!

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.430
We want some, too!

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.800
Shut up, you selfish spies.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.760
Damn. It was so easy to get 
in that we let our guard down.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.120
There weren't any checks at the gate.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.150
And the nice villagers showed us where to go!

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:58.680
And the mayor was super-friendly at first!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.550
And then they just arrest us out of nowhere!

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:02.890
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:05.020
See? I-chan's mad, too!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:10.490
Not interested. Are you ready to tell me
 why you selfishly came to this village?

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:13.620
Don't insult us, guru!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.950
Do you think I'd just tell you 
about the quest we were given...

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:22.480
We're here to take out the large 
spiral you're secretly keeping here, guru.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.500
He said it.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.600
No fair!

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:29.550
You got tricked again.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:32.340
I don't need anything else from you.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.180
What?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.350
Don't breathe it in.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.060
Kikazaru!

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:50.860
I see. So Bossy Village has already 
found out about my spiral?

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.720
I'll need to selfishly move up the plan.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:56.250
Selfishly send them to the processing room.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.870
Wait, mayor.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.700
What is it, Sonya?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.670
I checked the data attained by my sister,

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.340
and that girl could be valuable to us.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.920
I believe she'll be perfect for 
the next phase of the plan.

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:24.590
Wiseman!

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:47.290
Coming!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.180
You're...

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.900
Wiseman's boss!

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.430
Help them.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:02.220
They... Wiseman hasn't come back!

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:04.820
Don't tell me! They never 
came back after that?

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:08.730
We'll go now!

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.140
Thank you... Haru-kun.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.490
I think it's about time you started talking...

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.920
About how the branch office went bankrupt.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:27.620
How you're using Wiseman to drive 
Haru-kun's team to do what you want.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:32.090
It's all connected, isn't it?

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:33.900
Yes.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:40.520
It's time for me to tell you, isn't it?

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.060
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.190
We looked really cool when 
we ran out of there, but...

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.640
How do we get in?

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:53.560
Security looks tight.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.860
And there are spirals on the walls.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.460
I finally found you!

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.440
Hey there, Haru-kun and the gang!

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.390
Iona-san...

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:03.720
Who said he's our leader?

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.190
It's the girl who's barely 
gotten any screen time lately.

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:08.410
Would you not just come out and say it?

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:10.640
Well, it's true.

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:13.940
Honestly, I was thinking I 
might've just been forgotten.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.790
I've got a lot of other jobs, you know.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.570
Was she always this much
 of a pain in the butt?

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.800
Yeah, actually.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.900
But if we've met like this,

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:26.700
it means that my luck is going up, up, up!

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:28.100
Ready for me to make a call?

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.910
No! I feel bad for you, Iona,

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.230
but I've really stopped making calls.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.760
That's what everybody says,

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:37.970
but you're aching to do it, right?

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.280
You want it so bad...

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.280
I do not!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.580
We don't have time for this!

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:46.940
Hey, you go to all the 
different villages, right?

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.550
Do you know a good way to get 
inside without drawing attention?

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.380
Selfish Village, huh?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.800
The mayor's word is law there,

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.600
so it's easy if he likes you.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:01.470
If the mayor likes us?

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:05.680
So you're a selfish troupe
 of traveling entertainers?

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.520
We're honored to meet you!

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:11.720
We've all got different things to show you,

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:14.230
like cooking, pro wrestling, 
and magic tricks!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.590
Is this really going to work?

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.570
I've never done a magic trick.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.900
And I've never cooked for anybody.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.740
I feel like as long as I've 
got energy, I can do anything!

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:27.160
Sounds selfishly good.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:31.790
I guess we'll start by having you two 
pretty girls show me a selfish magic trick.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:33.320
Already?

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:34.560
This is our chance!

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:39.280
While we distract him, the others
 can search the palace!

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.920
R-Right.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:41.890
Okay...

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:48.760
M-Mayor, please enjoy the magic 
of Lizanses and Chohcoh!

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.530
I've been waiting for this!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:53.060
Liza, Choco, I'm counting on you.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:02.650
Okay, what will you be starting with?

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:04.170
Selfish levitation?

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:05.450
A selfish escape?

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.450
Liza is way more amazing.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.870
Why are you making this harder?

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.890
Um, for now...

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:15.950
Ta-da!

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:17.950
Ta-da...

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:21.810
Bravo! Bravo!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.410
So far, it's all according to plan.

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:29.400
There's not a lot of security 
in the palace, it looks like.

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.480
We need to find Wiseman fast.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.980
But where are they?

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.200
Let's just start with one 
side and work our way down.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.710
Hey, Haru-kun.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.890
We don't know what we're going to meet.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.090
You might want to make a call.

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.280
I told you, no way.

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.670
No way!

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.250
I told you!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.160
Hey, Haru-kun! Call! Call!

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.320
Not happening!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.110
Damn it.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.710
There are spirals behind every single door!

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.400
Don't tell me there's one 
behind all the others, too.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.920
See? Don't you think you should make a call?

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.460
N-No.

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:18.200
Jeez, we're getting nowhere like this!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.620
Do you have any ideas?

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:22.040
I'm not the best person to ask.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:26.220
You could try relying on some kind 
of fortune-telling or psychic power.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.670
Psychic power?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.740
Sorry, Miu...

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:38.680
Find Wiseman for us!

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.000
We're counting on you, Miu!

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.240
Diagonally down?

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.560
So Wiseman's down here!

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:50.250
Does that actually work?

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:52.180
Yup! I believe Miu!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:03.940
Here?

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:10.490
There they are! That's Wiseman!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.980
But they look weird...

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.560
Do they?

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:21.840
Intruders sighted. Exterminate!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.940
Yeah, they do look weird.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:34.470
You truly are selfishly
legendary illusionists, Lizanses and Chohcoh!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.190
Thank you, thank you.

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:39.940
I'm so glad that satisfied him.

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.170
Whisper, whisper,whisper...

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.850
Got it.

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:46.310
You guys must be selfishly tired!

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.600
Have some selfish candy before dinner.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.310
Candy!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.260
Thanks!

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:55.810
It's so good!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:56.680
What is it?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:59.040
It's my village's specialty...

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.570
selfish Joy Gummies.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.540
Wake up, Wiseman!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.620
It's me!

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.060
Snap out of it!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.380
Hey, this looks bad!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:22.280
You should make a call!

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:23.660
I'm not doing that!

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:25.890
But this isn't good, Haru!

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:27.940
We have to fight for real, or we're finished.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.030
I can't do it.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.200
I can't draw my sword against you.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.490
So...

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.240
Miu attack!

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:41.670
Where am I, guru?

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.040
He's back to normal!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.000
Is that it?

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:48.050
As long as I know that, this'll be easy!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.480
We're really sorry, guru!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:53.260
We attacked you when you came to save us.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.600
I'm so ashamed.

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.390
Don't worry.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.960
You were being mind-controlled.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:01.520
With these little machines.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.510
Well, I'm glad you're safe.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.060
Let's get out of here!

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.950
What is it, I-chan?

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.030
Luluna's being held somewhere else?

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:16.840
Luluna?

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:22.430
And Sonya's there, too?!

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:27.240
What's Sonya-san doing here?

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.080
She's an android.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:30.840
There's a bunch of companies that sell her.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:33.680
This way?

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:38.710
They're following the exact route.

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:40.220
How selfishly impressive.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.870
Is it okay to let them go?

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:46.560
We'll make them witness our selfish victory.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.960
The moment when it awakens.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.400
What is "it"?

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.070
What's your deal?

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.400
You've even got Sonya here.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:55.670
And you're tying up us helpless girls.

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:57.680
What are you thinking?

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.810
Is it dinnertime yet?

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.320
Selfishly rejoice!

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:04.640
You will be witness to a 
great, selfish moment in history.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:05.960
What do you mean?

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.090
Do you selfishly recognize this?

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.120
That's Luluna's.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.500
That's selfishly correct.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:17.300
Acquiring this power has 
vastly accelerated our plans.

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:21.640
Not just Bossy Village... We won't 
lose to any village out there.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.010
It was no coincidence that she came here.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:28.280
It was inevitable that she 
would aid our selfish victory.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:34.410
That pendant contains the
 selfish darkness of humanity.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:40.870
That's Luluna, guru!

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:45.000
We'll save you!

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.680
I won't let you!

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:52.130
You're going to die here for 
the glory of Selfish Village!

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:53.780
Sonya...

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.150
She really is here.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.340
She's just going to explode again.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.180
Unfortunately...

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:02.080
We've been patched!

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:03.870
Wrappings?

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.380
How primitive!

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.480
I thought they'd deflated a little.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.560
Exterminate!

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:12.250
Just one was hard enough.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:13.820
If there are so many...

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.120
We don't have a choice.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.280
Wiseman, we have to retreat.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:18.960
We'll regroup, and...

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:19.610
No.

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:24.540
We can't leave Luluna here.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:30.920
She said she liked us.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:34.420
She said it was fun to be with us.

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.420
She's a part of Wiseman, too.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.460
We won't leave her!

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:56.590
Everyone...

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.360
Haru-kun, would you please make a call?

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:01.780
Iona-san, I told you...

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:04.840
Just for today, you don't need a luna stone.

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.240
So do it.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:10.920
I want you to save my 
little sister, Luluna-chan?

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:11.620
Little...

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:12.460
...sister?

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:16.810
It looks like she's made some good friends.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:18.420
So please, Haru-kun!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:21.840
Okay!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.220
This is bad.

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:33.080
At this rate, Luluna will...

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.660
Everybody, let's go!

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:38.110
Wh-What?

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:40.540
The Color Rangers are here!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.020
Impossible!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:53.140
The data says we're much more powerful!

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.670
Why?

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.500
It's simple.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:02.040
People can be stronger when 
they fight for someone else!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:06.350
No! But I was patched!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.990
Galaxy...!

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:22.030
Wiseman?

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.920
I'm so glad.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:28.080
Why are you here, too, Big Sis?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.490
Just passing through.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.920
I guess that about wraps it up.

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:36.080
I don't think so.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:41.820
They took all the power
from Luluna-chan's pendant.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:44.500
The stone!

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:50.280
You selfishly wiped out my androids. Not bad!

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.350
It's the mean mayor, guru!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.850
Choco! Liza!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.520
It's Haru!

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:58.310
Enough power has been gathered already.

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.560
Awaken.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:02.430
Awaken, for my village!

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:04.900
My spiral!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.840
Oh, no!

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:09.990
Everybody, get out!

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.610
You guys, too, Choco!

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:17.360
What are you doing, Meme Girl?

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:33.660
Fidget, fidget! Fidget, fidget!

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.830
Feck!

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:38.080
I won't let that bossy Selfish Village
 get away with this!

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:42.070
Bossy Village is the strongest,
 most boss village, not them!

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:48.990
Surprised, losers?

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:52.910
This is Bossy Village's boss giant spiral!

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:58.120
What's going on here?!

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:01.000
Find out in part two.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 12
Last Period</b>

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:38.870
"Last Period."
